            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p>
          This is not really a portfolio, but my attempt at learning WebGL. <br>
          I wanted to learn WebGL for quite some time, especially after Internet Explorer started supporting it.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="tails__section tails__section--skills">
        <h1 class="tails__section__el"> MY SKILLS </h1>
        <h2 class="tails__section__el"> Javascript </h2>
        <div class="tails__section__el">
